  "description": "Terra by Rayhaan is an earthy, balanced fragrance built around green botanicals, vetiver depth, and a clean woody-musk finish. It opens with a natural green freshness—think crushed herbs, citrus peels, and fresh outdoor air. The heart deepens into rich vetiver, tea-like aromatics, and subtle wood texture that keeps it modern, not dirty. The base closes smooth with light amber warmth, soft woods, and long-lasting musk that holds the scent gently but confidently. It fits customers who enjoy grounded, fresh-earthy perfumes with a natural, wearable character.",
